This repository includes material adapted from `icp-synthesis` by Nick Christensen
(https://github.com/nickyc1/ship-icp-ads-automate-monitoring), used under the MIT licence below.

The adapted material is the ICP method: how customers are segmented, scored and ranked,
and how the ideal customer profile is written. Parts of its wording are kept as written.
It is mainly in:

- plugins/gtm-icp/skills/icp-buying-group/SKILL.md
- plugins/gtm-icp/templates/icp.md

Short phrases from the same source also appear in plugins/gtm-icp/templates/gtm/RULES.md,
plugins/gtm-icp/commands/dossier.md and plugins/gtm-icp/templates/icp-dossier.html.

The buying group, the personas, the CRM scorecard script (crm_profile.py), the setup,
the sync between the Markdown files and the page, the draft and final step, and the
example data are original to this repository.

